    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d297">

                <pb facs="0488" n="418" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg418"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">[Telegram]</note>
                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Campbell</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-06-15"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >June</hi> 15, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>It is important that the minister to Mexico should proceed at once. Your
                    resignation will, therefore, be accepted, with thanks for your service and
                    regret for your retirement. Communicate by telegraph.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lewis D. Campell,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c., New Orleans.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
